# ws/arch-readpath — block decode, lease option, libpq lazy shape

Branch `ws/arch-readpath`, base `merge/transport` (`303366d`). Same command on
`fpq-baseline` (main@7e3d2e6) and `fpq-arch-readpath`, one at a time under
`/tmp/fpq-bench.lock`.

What changed:

1. `decode_rows(columns, start, count)` decodes a row window per column in C.
   Lazy iteration uses 1024-row blocks (`_ITER_BLOCK`); materialisation uses
   4096-row blocks. Indexing stays one-row. `force_tuples=True` /
   `FASTPOSTGRES_MATERIALIZE=1` keep the old row-frame path.
2. `FASTPOSTGRES_LEASE=1` / `Connection(lease=True)` keeps the ring checked out
   and borrows the segment instead of copying each column. The last two batches
   stay borrowed; a segment being reused copies its older frame first.
   `FASTPOSTGRES_LEASE_BATCH` sets the request size for that opt-in mode.
3. A libpq fallback read now returns the same `ResultSet` shape, backed by a
   native `LazyResult` holding the `PGresult`; forced tuples and non-read
   statements keep the eager result.

No wire-format change.

## Commands

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker build -q --target dev -t fpq-arch-readpath -f docker/Dockerfile .'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g fpq-arch-readpath tests.sh'

    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=baseline fpq-baseline benchmarks.sh 100000 1000000'
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c 'docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=arch-readpath fpq-arch-readpath benchmarks.sh 100000 1000000'

    PROBE=$PWD/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c "docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=baseline -v $PROBE:/src/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py:ro fpq-baseline python3 /src/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py 100000 1000000"
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c "docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=arch-readpath -v $PROBE:/src/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py:ro fpq-arch-readpath python3 /src/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py 100000 1000000"
    flock /tmp/fpq-bench.lock -c "docker run --rm --shm-size=3g -e BENCH_GIT_REV=arch-readpath-lease -e FASTPOSTGRES_LEASE=1 -e FASTPOSTGRES_LEASE_BATCH=1000000 -v $PROBE:/src/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py:ro fpq-arch-readpath python3 /src/bench/jobs/row-iteration.py 100000 1000000"

